'''Chroma Snowstorm''' is a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] knife that had a rare chance to be obtained from purchasing the Snowy Bundle for 3,399 Robux during the [[Christmas Event 2025|2025 Christmas Event]]. it is now only obtainable through trading as the gamepass has gone offsale

== Appearance ==
It has the same appearance as [[Snowstorm]], but with alternating colors.

== Trivia ==
* It is the chroma counterpart of the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife under the name [[Snowstorm]].
* It partners with the gun [[Chroma Blizzard]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Chroma Blizzard Set|Chroma Blizzard Set]].
* This and [[Chroma Blizzard]] are the first chroma weapons to be obtainable through a gamepass.

